  "content": "<p><span>這是 ItemPhysic 的精簡版本，因此僅有視覺效果（僅限客戶端）！可在原版伺服器上使用！</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/itemphysic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ItemPhysic 完整版</a></p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">需要 <a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creativecore\" rel=\"nofollow\">CreativeCore</a></span> 功能</strong></p><p>增強物品動畫</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">正在尋找能與朋友一同遊玩的伺服器嗎？我們的贊助商已經為您準備好了：</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">[![](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fimages%252flogos%252fdark_text%25401538x500.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/logos/dark_text@1538x500.png</a>)](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fteamcreative\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/teamcreative</a>)</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">使用優惠碼 \\\\\\*\\\\\\*teamcreative\\\\\\*\\\\\\*，即可在首次租用任一遊戲伺服器時享受 25% 折扣！</p><p><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/2076336-itemphysic-1-3-4-more-realtistic-items-stone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">舊版下載</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/creativemd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/g2vJewK.png\" alt=\"\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/W9QM3fS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/YF5WrZ1.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
